-- 3. SPLIT the cleaned string on blanks to create an ARRAY of words.
-- 4. FLATTEN that array so each token is a separate row for inspection.
-- 5. Remove empty strings produced by adjacent blanks.
-- 6. Focus on the single article whose id is ‘8a78ef2d-d5f7-4d2d-9b47-5adb25cbd373’.
-- 7. Show the first 20 tokens so we can verify the ad-hoc tokeniser works.
